    <section id="drone-restoration" aria-labelledby="drone-title">
      <p class="tag">Active project · Phase 1</p>
      <h2 id="drone-title">Quadcopter restoration</h2>
      <p>
        I’m restoring an existing damaged quadcopter as a personal research
        project. I’ll inspect the airframe, identify its parts, and document
        repair and testing decisions as I go.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Current focus:</strong> Inspect the airframe and inventory its parts.</p>

      <div class="project-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img
            src="images/drone-before.JPG"
            alt="The existing quadcopter frame before restoration"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          >
          <figcaption>
            <strong>Initial airframe</strong><br>
            The drone before the parts inspection.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="status" class="project-status" aria-labelledby="project-status-title">
      <div class="status-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="tag">Project status</p>
          <h2 id="project-status-title">Drone restoration</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="status-pill">Planning and inspection</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        I’m documenting the restoration from the starting condition through
        testing. I’ll update these milestones as the project progresses.
      </p>

      <ol class="milestones">
        <li>
          <span class="milestone-state">Recorded</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Capture the starting condition</strong>
            <p>The starting photo is included in the project gallery.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="current">
          <span class="milestone-state">Current</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Inspect and inventory the parts</strong>
            <p>Identify the frame, motors, electronics, battery, and any unknown parts.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="milestone-state">Planned</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Decide what needs repair or replacement</strong>
            <p>Record the decisions and estimated costs before ordering parts.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="milestone-state">Planned</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Test the restored drone</strong>
            <p>Document each test and its results as the build progresses.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p class="next-step">
        <strong>Next action:</strong> Make a parts inventory and note each item’s
        label, condition, and whether you have identified it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="constraints" aria-labelledby="constraints-title">
      <h2 id="constraints-title">Goal and constraints</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Goal:</strong> Restore the existing quadcopter and document the process.</li>
        <li><strong>Starting point:</strong> A damaged drone frame with parts to identify.</li>
        <li><strong>Resources:</strong> Personal research and a limited budget.</li>
        <li><strong>Budget:</strong> To be set after the parts inventory.</li>
        <li><strong>Size, payload, and flight time:</strong> To be determined after inspection.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>


    <section id="inventory" aria-labelledby="inventory-title">
      <h2 id="inventory-title">Component inventory</h2>
      <p>
        I’ll record the label, condition, and planned action for each component.
        If I can’t identify a part yet, I’ll mark it as unknown rather than guess.
      </p>

      <div class="inventory-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable component inventory">
        <table class="inventory-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Component</th>
              <th scope="col">Make / model</th>
              <th scope="col">Condition</th>
              <th scope="col">Planned action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Frame</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>Record damage and check whether it can be reused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Motors</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>Record labels and condition</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Speed controllers (ESCs)</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>Record labels and condition</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Flight controller</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>Record label and condition</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Battery</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>Record label and condition</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Propellers and radio equipment</td>
              <td>To identify</td>
              <td>To inspect</td>
              <td>List each item and note anything missing</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="decisions" aria-labelledby="decisions-title">
      <h2 id="decisions-title">Design decisions and open questions</h2>
      <p>
        I’ll record important choices here, along with the evidence behind them.
      </p>

      <div class="inventory-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable design decisions">
        <table class="inventory-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Question or decision</th>
              <th scope="col">Evidence needed</th>
              <th scope="col">Status</th>
              <th scope="col">Conclusion</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Which existing components can be reused?</td>
              <td>Identify and inspect each component</td>
              <td>Open</td>
              <td>To be determined</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="restoration-plan" aria-labelledby="plan-title">
      <h2 id="plan-title">Restoration plan</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Inspect the airframe and record visible damage.</li>
        <li>Identify the components and assess their condition.</li>
        <li>Decide what can be reused, repaired, or replaced.</li>
        <li>Document assembly and checks.</li>
        <li>Record test results and update the project requirements.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section id="build-log" aria-labelledby="build-log-title">
      <h2 id="build-log-title">Build log</h2>
      <article>
        <h3>Project kickoff</h3>
        <p class="tag">October 2, 2026</p>
        <p>
          I’m starting by inspecting the existing frame and identifying its
          parts before setting final design targets.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="test-log" aria-labelledby="test-log-title">
      <h2 id="test-log-title">Test log</h2>
      <p>
        I’ll record each test here, including the setup, observations, and what
        I plan to change next.
      </p>

      <div class="test-log-note">
        <strong>For each test, record:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Date and test objective</li>
          <li>Parts and setup used</li>
          <li>What happened, including measurements if available</li>
          <li>Result and next action</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

